# PipiUI AI workspace rule

[`CONSTITUTION.md`](../../CONSTITUTION.md) is binding and is the single
source of truth.

- Create Cursor tasks with `./scripts/new-ai-worktree.sh --tool cursor ...`.
- Open and edit only the returned linked worktree.
- Run `./scripts/verify-worker.sh` for worker-local validation.
- Never install or replace `/Applications/PipiUI.app`; only the integration
  owner may run `./scripts/ship-app.sh`.
- Do not merge, clean another workspace, or claim canonical delivery.
